    Turnstiles -->|MQTT 5 QoS 1| ZoneBroker
    Jetson -->|MQTT 5 QoS 1| ZoneBroker
    ZoneBroker -->|mTLS WAN Bridge| Kafka

    %% Monoliths to Kafka & DBs
