    Living -->|Produces/Consumes CloudEvents| Kafka
    ParkOps -->|Produces/Consumes CloudEvents| Kafka
    GuestGrowth -->|Produces/Consumes CloudEvents| Kafka

    Ticketing --> Postgres
    Living --> Postgres
    Living --> Timescale
    ParkOps --> Timescale
    GuestGrowth --> RedisStore

